e","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An elite Kinsekikai bruiser obsessed with his shield, which seems to have a habit of abandoning him when he needs it the most, leaving him in despair.","abilities":["Has Barrier, and loses Barrier when shifted","DEF is reduced when Barrier is lost"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":20000,"atk":1200,"def":1500,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"mio":{"slug":"mio","name":"Mio","icon":"/enemies-icons/Mio.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Drive out oni, and you drive out dreams. Welcome in curses, and you welcome in kindness. Ask not of right or wrong, or good and evil. She simply draws her sword in silence.","abilities":["Attacks hit 2 times","[Icy Gaze] After several attacks, the next attack strikes twice with higher damage","Bounces <'Certain Fates'>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":50000,"atk":777,"def":900,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"certain_fates_enemy_10111_ymgpck":{"slug":"certain_fates_enemy_10111_ymgpck","name":"'Certain Fates'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Certain Fates'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"The size of a fingertip, the weight of a murmur of fate and inertia. It does not intend to destroy, not even to arrive. It only follows the shortest path of inevitability and the longest path of coincidence, spinning and moving forward. In its own time, the world is simply walls to collide with, propositions to bounce off, cacophonous and silent.","abilities":["Gain 'Favor' when it collides with an enemy","Disappears when it stops moving","Disappears after a while"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true